    learningObjectives: ['Convert integers and fractions between binary, octal, decimal, and hexadecimal.', 'Explain positional weights and radix-point expansion.', 'Use unsigned, sign-magnitude, 1\'s-complement, and 2\'s-complement representations.', 'Detect overflow and distinguish numerical value from bit pattern.'],
