    learningObjectives: ['Read and construct truth tables for standard gates.', 'Express AND, OR, NOT, NAND, NOR, XOR, and XNOR as Boolean equations.', 'Build functions using universal gates.', 'Account for propagation delay, fan-out, and logic-level assumptions.'],
